# NVIDIA's CUDA repository for Debian 13, flat (sources.list(5): "suite can specify an exact path, in which case the
# components must be omitted and suite must end with a slash"), read for amd64 only: the edition's NVIDIA user space and
# CUDA are 64-bit. Signed-By names NVIDIA's own key file, the one NVIDIA's cuda-keyring installs, so a source written
# NVIDIA's way names the same key (apt refuses two sources for one URI with different Signed-By).
# sparky-stereo-cuda-repo installs this file; 91sparky-stereo-cuda holds its pins.
Types: deb
URIs: https://developer.download.nvidia.com/compute/cuda/repos/debian13/x86_64/
Suites: /
Architectures: amd64
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/cuda-archive-keyring.gpg
